SUMMARY:MACRO Seminar: Sephorah Mangin\, Australian National University
LOCATION:North Hall 2111
DESCRIPTION:Speaker: Sephorah Mangin\, Australian National University\nHo
 sted by: Peter Rupert\n\nSephorah Mangin is an Associate Professor in Ec
 onomics. Her research interests include macroeconomics\, search theory\,
  labour economics\, economic growth\, and industrial organisation. She h
 as conducted research at the Becker Friedman Institute at the University
  of Chicago\, and is an Associate Editor at the European Economic Review
 . Sephorah has published her research in a number of prestigious peer-re
 viewed journals including the Journal of Economic Theory\, the Journal o
 f Monetary Economics\, the RAND Journal of Economics\, and Econometrica.
 \n\nhttps://econ.ucsb.edu/events/all/2026/macro-seminar-sephorah-mangin-
 australian-national-university
